{"id":"b78700f82584ead6","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-iteration-convergence.md","title":"单调幂集跳跃在闭包序数稳定","display":"thm-iteration-convergence — 单调幂集跳跃在闭包序数稳定","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-iteration-convergence","aliases":["91-thm-iteration-convergence","91-thm-truth-iteration-limit","91-thm-iteration-bound"],"display":"thm-iteration-convergence — 单调幂集跳跃在闭包序数稳定","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-iteration]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-lem-jump-monotonicity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-iteration-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-iteration-convergence</span><span>91-thm-truth-iteration-limit</span><span>91-thm-iteration-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-iteration-convergence — 单调幂集跳跃在闭包序数稳定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ebf36f4bba071548\" href=\"?note=ebf36f4bba071548\" title=\"91-df-truth-iteration\">91-df-truth-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2afb05d81a538d8a\" href=\"?note=2afb05d81a538d8a\" title=\"91-lem-jump-monotonicity\">91-lem-jump-monotonicity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span> (关于包含关系单调的跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\subseteq S\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to J(X)\\subseteq J(Y))\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\subseteq S\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to J(X)\\subseteq J(Y))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))\">\\(\\eta\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing,\\ \\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha),\\\n\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta\">\\(\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing,\\ \\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha),\\\n\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta\\)</span>\n(对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\lambda&lt;\\eta\">\\(\\alpha,\\lambda&lt;\\eta\\)</span> 的超限递归)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\)</span> (最小固定点)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\to\n\\exists\\kappa&lt;\\eta\\,\n\\left[\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\Gamma_{\\kappa+1}\n=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\eta\\,\n(\\kappa\\leq\\alpha\\to\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_\\kappa)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\to\n\\exists\\kappa&lt;\\eta\\,\n\\left[\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\Gamma_{\\kappa+1}\n=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\eta\\,\n(\\kappa\\leq\\alpha\\to\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_\\kappa)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>阶段递增，而幂集格只有集合大小的高度，所以严格增长不可能无限越过\n所有序数；首个稳定阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 是该迭代的闭包序数。到达固定点后，\n后继和极限阶段都保持不变。</p>\n<p>仅由“定义良好”不能断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\omega_1^{CK}\">\\(\\kappa=\\omega_1^{CK}\\)</span>，也不能断言每个\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1^{CK}\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1^{CK}\\)</span> 阶段都严格增长。精确 Church–Kleene 界需要\n指定规范的有效语言、编码与强 Kleene 跳跃，并使用额外可计算性分析。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"ebf36f4bba071548","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-lem-jump-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"2afb05d81a538d8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-lem-jump-monotonicity]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\subseteq S\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to J(X)\\subseteq J(Y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing,\\ \\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha),\\\n\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta<\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\lambda<\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\to\n\\exists\\kappa<\\eta\\,\n\\left[\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\Gamma_{\\kappa+1}\n=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha<\\eta\\,\n(\\kappa\\leq\\alpha\\to\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_\\kappa)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa=\\omega_1^{CK}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\omega_1^{CK}",